add('p','The working analysis package contains the exact pronunciation entries, event selections, input hashes, simulation draws, summary data, and figure inputs for this draft. Source EEG files are traceable to ghostTalkerAlpha commit 40fe0cf64e79916ced50cb82d7d0ee03f77b41c3 [4]. [AUTHOR ACTION: deposit the approved package and permitted source data or stable source links, assign a fixed release or archival DOI, verify reuse terms, and insert that identifier here. The live main branch alone is not the identifier for the numerical results in this draft.]')
